text = "This area has an arena for the Puppetmaster boss fight.
Puppetmaster is primarily a magician, which is rare at this point in the game.
Puppetmaster also summons enemies because they're the Puppetmaster.
Once you beat Puppetmaster, you get to see the light of Heaven's Point.
This is supposed to be an important reveal."

